 "OPEN_PROBLEM_jabba_grapples": "Jabba is described from play as dense with grapples, both buildable and static, but its script contains NO id-227 records. Its grapples are therefore unaccounted for in this table. Either they use ids not yet identified - 7 and 8 are the numerous candidates but were wrongly assigned once already - or Jabba grapples are placed by a mechanism other than these type-4 records. Do not close this by assuming.",
